{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-06-22 06:30:00', 'title': 'OSLO METROPOLITAN UNIVERSITY IN NORWAY TO ESTABLISH TRIMBLE TECHNOLOGY LAB FOR CIVIL ENGINEERING AND ENERGY TECHNOLOGY', 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF. AND OSLO, NORWAY, JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORWAY'S OSLO METROPOLITAN UNIVERSITY (OSLOMET) HAS RECEIVED A GIFT FROM TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) TO ESTABLISH A STATE-OF-THE-ART TECHNOLOGY LAB FOR CIVIL ENGINEERING AND ENERGY TECHNOLOGY."}